ficult to even know what possible  criminal charges are on the table but  the bottom line is you've got the right  increasingly saying even if this  happened there would be no crimes to  speak of that's very incorrect right  many laws may have been broken but we  don't yet know what is their actual  evidence of and just because you have  evidence doesn't mean that there will  necessarily be charges or impeachment or  anything else so don't fall for none of  this would be illegal anyway  because collusion per se isn't a crime  collusions a general umbrella term and  there are any number of possible crimes  that have been committed whether we'll  see charges or prosecution is a  different story and under a Republican  House and Senate we may well not discuss  this with us on our reddit discussion  forum at david pakman.com slash our IDI  di t back with part two of my interview  with William Gardner after the break the  video you just watched was made possible  by support from you please go to  patreon.com/scishow you can make a  pledge of as little as one dollar per  month and every dollar helps to support  the work that we're doing particularly  in light of the YouTube ad boycott which  has been really bad
 

